 :root-cause
 "The generated-artifact size gate was implemented as a Babashka executable, but the formal GitHub Actions job installed Clojure, clj-kondo, and Node without installing Babashka. Every proof and generated build passed before the gate failed with /usr/bin/env: bb: No such file or directory."
 :fix
 "The formal workflow now installs the exact Babashka 1.12.213 version used locally before invoking the post-build artifact gate, and the quantitative gate regression asserts both the runtime declaration and build-before-measurement order."
 :closing-evidence
 ["GitHub Actions run 30911913172 job 92000487051"
